      "message": "Nit: the first body line runs to 74 columns. Could the paragraph be rewrapped at 72? While at it, I think the `OVERCOMMIT_GUESS` sentence only applies to mappings of 4KB processes. Something like:\n\n```\nP3S accounts mappings in process-page units, but vm_committed_as is\nshared by 4KB and native 16KB processes. Treating 4KB charges as native\npages reports their Committed_AS four times too high and charges them\nfour times against strict overcommit limits. OVERCOMMIT_GUESS also\nrejects a single accounted mapping of a 4KB process larger than one\nquarter of RAM plus swap.\n```",
